  <x:String x:Key="Settings.Email.AddButton">添加</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Settings.Email.Import">从 Thunderbird 导入</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Settings.Email.Test">测试</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Settings.Email.Remove">删除</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Settings.Web.Header">网页浏览配置</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Settings.Web.Note">每日抓取会读取的页面。只发 GET，不会提交表单。需要登录的站点，Cookie 由浏览器插件提供，并按域名逐个向你确认。</x:String>
